team \"Champion\" is misleading! Only mark Champion/Relegated when venue == \"all\". Fix.\n\nAlso the h2h line in search_matches shows Flamengo/Corinthians counts ✓ nice.\n\nLet me fix stage matching + champion labeling, then write tests.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05b998b76001M8KsodEXdoENwZ","sessionID":"ses_fa4885bb0ffe9T9m197C2RPPvh","messageID":"msg_05b9956b5001glQ28524rClvuP"}}
