ome.key, tail[0].away.key,\n+                tail[1].home.key, tail[1].away.key,\n+            }\n+            if len(teams) == 2:\n+                for match in tail:\n+                    match.stage = \"Final\"\n+\n # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n # Phase 1 - team registration (suffixed sources first)\n # ------------------------------------------------------------------\n \n","additions":41,"deletions":0},"truncated":false},"title":"brazilian_soccer/loader.py","time":{"start":1788243255158,"end":1788243255160}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[]}},"id":"prt_05b9a84ea001ZX60iDmWi8ORRI","sessionID":"ses_fa4885bb0ffe9T9m197C2RPPvh","messageID":"msg_05b9a7cb5001P2d14FzZdjajPZ"}}
